{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はオトナヘノベルの放送日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張したよーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、放送を見て\nもっと演技が上手になりたいって\n思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは演技をさせてもらう\n機会を増やせるようにがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女優さんってかっこいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/18/6579947/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/18/6579947/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レナ役のあやぼーさんと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやぼーさんのブログみたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやぼうって言ってたけど\nあやぼーだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失礼しました(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやぼーさんとね、\nご飯行く約束したの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ年上なんだけど\nお姉ちゃんみたいで\n優しくて綺麗で\n一瞬でだいすきになった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/18/6579947/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからこの間久しぶりに\n親友のつぐれなちゃんとも会って\nたのしかったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"性格も顔も可愛くて\n一緒にいるとキュンとする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも会うとプライベートな話もするけど\nお仕事の話もするんだ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構真剣にお仕事のはなしするの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなのライブいきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度絶対いく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まってて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/18/6579947/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/18/6579947/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛おしいみなみちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/18/6579947/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、またあした！"}],"source":"archive"}